{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-376600-r4517541","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Jamaican Curry Chicken with Bullga","sourcePageId":376600,"sourceRevision":"4517541","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T02:43:11Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Jamaican%20Curry%20Chicken%20with%20Bullga&oldid=4517541","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:07:05.501Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Jamaican recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for curry","Category:Recipes using bread","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using curry powder","Category:Recipes using lime juice","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"4c1fa68c633f3c95d597a891bc026c3f1f333638d2cf1251baced5b70b1420b2","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Chicken recipes\n| Time = 1 hour 45 minutes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{Recipe}}\n\nBulla cakes are a variety of Jamaican bread made with molasses. Here, the cakes are paired with a chicken curry.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] meat\n* [[Cookbook:Lime|Lime]] juice or [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Green Onion|green onions]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]], chopped\n* 2 red [[Cookbook:Chiles|chile peppers]], chopped\n* 4 packs of Jamaican [[Cookbook:Curry Powder|curry powder]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* Ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* Just over ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 1 pack of bulla cakes\n== Procedure ==\n# Cut chicken in equally-sized pieces.\n# Rinse the chicken in lime juice.\n# Combine the chicken with the green onions, onions, chile peppers, curry powder, salt, and pepper. Let [[Cookbook:Marinating|marinate]] 5–10 minutes.\n# Heat olive oil in a [[Cookbook:Pots and Pans|pot]]. Add the chicken mixture, and cook for 30–60 minutes. \n# Serve with bulla cakes.\n[[Category:Jamaican recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes for curry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using curry powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Jamaican Curry Chicken with Bullga","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 lb chicken meat","sourceText":"2 lb chicken meat","amountText":"2 lb chicken meat","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Lime juice or vinegar","sourceText":"Lime juice or vinegar","amountText":"Lime juice or vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 green onions, chopped","sourceText":"3 green onions, chopped","amountText":"3 green onions, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 onions, chopped","sourceText":"2 onions, chopped","amountText":"2 onions, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 red chile peppers, chopped","sourceText":"2 red chile peppers, chopped","amountText":"2 red chile peppers, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"4 packs of Jamaican curry powder","sourceText":"4 packs of Jamaican curry powder","amountText":"4 packs of Jamaican curry powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"Ground black pepper","sourceText":"Ground black pepper","amountText":"Ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Just over ½ cup olive oil","sourceText":"Just over ½ cup olive oil","amountText":"Just over ½ cup olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"1 pack of bulla cakes","sourceText":"1 pack of bulla cakes","amountText":"1 pack of bulla cakes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Cut chicken in equally-sized pieces.","sourceText":"Cut chicken in equally-sized pieces.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Rinse the chicken in lime juice.","sourceText":"Rinse the chicken in lime juice.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Combine the chicken with the green onions, onions, chile peppers, curry powder, salt, and pepper. Let marinate 5–10 minutes.","sourceText":"Combine the chicken with the green onions, onions, chile peppers, curry powder, salt, and pepper. Let marinate 5–10 minutes.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Heat olive oil in a pot. Add the chicken mixture, and cook for 30–60 minutes.","sourceText":"Heat olive oil in a pot. Add the chicken mixture, and cook for 30–60 minutes.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":5,"text":"Serve with bulla cakes.","sourceText":"Serve with bulla cakes.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA p